{"ticker":"PTC","updated":"2026-10-23T23:48:21Z","profile":{"longName":"PTC Inc.","shortName":"PTC Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.ptc.com","fullTimeEmployees":7000,"marketCap":21052925952,"trailingPE":18.797283,"forwardPE":21.731987,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":7.126989,"pegRatio":1.82,"targetMeanPrice":201.0,"targetHighPrice":205.0,"targetLowPrice":170.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"none","revenueGrowth":-0.068,"earningsGrowth":-0.12,"grossMargins":0.84501,"operatingMargins":0.28232,"profitMargins":0.41429,"totalRevenue":2953971968,"beta":0.995,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":206.67,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":108.5,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"PTC Inc. operates as software company in the Americas, Europe, and the Asia Pacific. The company provides Windchill, a suite that manages all aspects of the product development lifecycle(PLM) that provides real-time information sharing, dynamic data visualization, collaborate across geographically distributed teams, and enabling manufacturers to elevate product development, manufacturing, field service, and end-of-life processes; ThingWorx, an Industrial Internet of Things software; ServiceMax, a service lifecycle management solutions enable companies to asset uptime with optimized in-person and remote service and technician productivity with mobile tools, and deliver metrics; and Arena, a SaaS PLM solution enables product teams to collaborate virtually to share product and quality information with internal teams and supply chain partners and deliver products to customers. It offers Codebeamer, an application lifecycle management for products and software development; Servigistics, a service parts management solution; and FlexPLM, a platform for merchandising and line planning, materials management, sampling, and others. In addition, it offers Kepware, an enterprise industrial connectivity solution; Kepware Edge, a Linux-based industrial communications platform; KEPServerEX, an industrial connectivity solution for small projects; Creo, a 3D CAD technology enables the digital de","summary_zh":"PTC Inc. 作為軟體公司在美洲、歐洲和亞太地區運作。該公司提供 Windchill，這是一個管理產品開發生命週期 (PLM) 各個方面的套件，提供即時資訊共享、動態資料視覺化、跨地理分佈的團隊協作，並使製造商能夠提升產品開發、製造、現場服務和報廢流程； ThingWorx，工業物聯網指標； ServiceMax 是一種服務生命週期管理解決方案，使公司能夠透過最佳的現場活動和執行工具來運作工具，透過操作Arena，SaaS PLM 解決方案使產品團隊能夠進行虛擬協作，與內部團隊和供應鏈合作夥伴共享產品和品質訊息，並向客戶交付產品。它提供 Codebeamer，一種用於產品和軟體開發的應用程式生命週期管理； Servigistics，一種服務備件管理解決方案； FlexPLM，一個用於銷售和生產線規劃、材料管理、樣品等的平台。此外，它還提供企業工業連接解決方案 Kepware； Kepware Edge，一個基於 Linux 的工業通訊平台； KEPServerEX，適用於小型專案的工業連接解決方案； Creo，一種 3D CAD 技術，可實現數位化設計","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":215.1,"h":216.48,"l":213.7,"c":214.35,"v":873200},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":213.61,"h":215.35,"l":212.12,"c":212.58,"v":737200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":212.89,"h":217.08,"l":210.0,"c":216.53,"v":705900},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":216.52,"h":217.64,"l":214.93,"c":215.03,"v":526000},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":215.52,"h":215.81,"l":213.03,"c":213.5,"v":1098700},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":210.39,"h":213.0,"l":208.85,"c":212.64,"v":809600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":212.13,"h":213.54,"l":211.29,"c":212.24,"v":506900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":211.27,"h":213.59,"l":210.29,"c":213.25,"v":639100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":213.5,"h":215.49,"l":211.42,"c":213.9,"v":632600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":215.22,"h":215.22,"l":209.9,"c":212.73,"v":1279800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":213.48,"h":213.48,"l":202.26,"c":204.03,"v":1474600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":204.16,"h":206.39,"l":202.4,"c":204.5,"v":1136000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":205.77,"h":207.26,"l":204.48,"c":207.03,"v":778800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":206.1,"h":206.73,"l":204.34,"c":205.11,"v":520500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":205.12,"h":208.56,"l":204.02,"c":204.15,"v":630300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":204.15,"h":205.87,"l":202.93,"c":204.95,"v":956000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":206.02,"h":206.64,"l":202.55,"c":203.98,"v":738200